    "kind": 1,
    "language": "markdown",
    "value": "### Exercise 4: OPC UA Production Shift Report\n**Task**: Create a complete shift reporting system that:\n- Monitors OPC UA counter data from `opcua/simulator/SlowUInt1`\n- Calculates hourly production rates\n- At the end of each shift (every 8 hours simulation or use 2 minutes for testing), stores a shift summary:\n  - Total parts produced\n  - Average parts per hour\n  - Minimum and maximum rates\n  - Equipment uptime percentage\n- Stores the shift report in the `production_records` table\n- Generates a quality inspection record if production rate drops below target\n\n**Hint**: Use `ON EVERY` for periodic calculations and combine with the ManufacturingDB route"
